description	"Exchange Infiltrator

A high-stakes corporate spy and saboteur. Lightly armored but equipped with cutting-edge espionage tech to disable targets and vanish.

^2Weaponry:
- Poisoned Vibro-Knife
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Low Damage/Poisons
-- Cyan Style
- Blackmarket Disintegrator (Clone Pistol 2)
-- Long Reload, Mag Reload, 10%+ Velocity

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (2)
- Force Sense Immunity
- Stamina (2)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]"